t itself with each new production.\nDynamO Théâtre is committed to offering bold theatre to a wide audience—children, teenagers, and families—telling stories that resonate physically and emotionally, and reflecting the world through the prisms of movement, image, and text. Its playground is vast, and its ambition to reach the hearts of humans, young and old, is greater still.\n"
