    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Goupil &amp; Kosmao - Saturday, May 9th, 2026"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Like in cabarets shows, the great magician Kosmao is on stage with his assistant named Goupil. Magic tricks happens until an accident because of Goupil, the rebel assistant. You have to know that, first he’s a fox, then a scarf before find this job.\nIn a classical humour duet, magic drive us into cartoon’s universe. A tribute to Tex Avery and Pixar’s studios classicals.\nAbout Étienne Saglio\nÉtienne Saglio is a juggler, twirler and magician who creates interplay and relationships with objects based on craftsmanship, detachment and transforming reality without dissembling. As it progresses, the work establishes the character and his world, creating a performance that comprises several levels of narrative. The story told introduces spectators into the twists and turns of a complex universe.\n"
      }
    ],
