        "@value": "Kintsugi"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Kintsugi is the art of sublimating imperfections.\nIn a bus shelter away from the world and time, strangers wait to be taken somewhere else. They don&#8217;t know when they&#8217;ll leave or where they&#8217;ll go. These motionless travelers rely on outside forces to lose themselves and, paradoxically, find something within themselves. This mysterious place awakens in everyone a thirst for life, for encounters and the unusual. A desire for solidarity, laughter and fun. In a sometimes waking dream, fragments of their past sculpt the present, revealing a new beauty.\nWith Kintsugi, Machine de Cirque creates a moment of great humanity, imbued with vertiginous acrobatic prowess. An inspiring plunge into life, which is here, now and full of beauty.\n"
      }
    ]
  },
