        "@value": "AlterIndiens - Compagnie | Mar. 24 — 26, 2022 | Le Diamant"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "The menu for the evening includes moose meat and vegetarian lasagna, just like a satire of our irreconcilable cultural differences. Everything is ready for this situational comedy to unfold."
      }
    ],
