  {
    "@id": "https://www.lediamant.ca/temporary/1448f9c0-10c7-415f-b458-afbe3d41ea89",
    "@type": [
      "http://schema.org/Play"
    ],
    "http://schema.org/url": [
      {
        "@id": "https://www.lediamant.ca/en/programming/six"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/image": [
      {
        "@id": "https://www.lediamant.ca/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Visuel-Six-700x700.jpg"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom": [
      {
        "@id": "https://www.lediamant.ca/en/programming/six"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Six°"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "One stormy night, five strangers receive a mysterious invitation that leads them to an old, abandoned building in the heart of the forest.\nThe visitors discover that this house has a soul and a personality all of its own. When you’ve been invited in by the house and cross its threshold, you have the strange impression that it knows you inside out.\nWhile you’re there, it talks to you (that&#8217;s right, this house can talk!), it guides you, and it reveals aspects of your personality that you didn&#8217;t know you had. The house and its control box might throw you challenges along the way, but there will also be fun, good cheer and some amazing acrobatic feats!\nJoin master trickster Jamie Adkins and his friends for this amazing acrobatic comedy from FLIP Fabrique: in it the mundane becomes magical, and ingenuity’s always involved !\nOn this planet, there are just six degrees of separation between us all.\nAnd since there are only five people on stage, what if the sixth person—the missing link—was you ?\n"
      }
    ]
  },
