        "@id": "https://www.lediamant.ca/en/programming/la-galerie"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "La Galerie"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The circus takes over the museum!\nSeven eccentric acrobats and an electrifying musician take over a monochrome exhibition. With a burst of creativity, they transform it into an explosion of colors. Playfully defying conventions, these characters, as whimsical as they are endearing, eagerly explore the backstage.\nDizzying feats, surprising discoveries, colorful poetry, and self-deprecation are all part of this ode to creativity.\nLet yourself be captivated by this unique experience. Step into La Galerie !\n"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
