        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Blizzard"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "With Blizzard, FLIP Fabrique takes you on a crazy, poetic and gentle journey into the dead of winter and invites you to lose yourself in a moment of complete wonder. With performers at the peak of their art and outstanding visual poetry, Blizzard promises to blow away everything in its path.\nThis contemporary circus show will inspire the young and the not-so-young to embrace the upcoming winter season with open hearts and enthusiasm.\n"
      }
    ]
  },
