        "@value": "Les Sept branches de la rivière Ōta - Ex Machina / Robert Lepage | Sept. 7 — 15, 2019 | Le Diamant"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "The Ōta River and its tributaries flow through the city of Hiroshima, where they separate before reaching the Seto Inland Sea. In the heart of this delta is the Aioi, a bridge that has a giant T shape when seen from above."
      }
    ],
