  {
    "@id": "https://www.lediamant.ca/temporary/13d03c8a-6f7c-48fd-8fd2-a29899477362",
    "@type": [
      "http://schema.org/Play"
    ],
    "http://schema.org/url": [
      {
        "@id": "https://www.lediamant.ca/en/programming/sacre"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/image": [
      {
        "@id": "https://www.lediamant.ca/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/Visuel-Sacre-Pedro-Greig-700x700.jpg"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom": [
      {
        "@id": "https://www.lediamant.ca/en/programming/sacre"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "SACRE"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Poetic tenderness. Raw emotion. Physical strength.\nTen acrobats from the Circa ensemble bring Stravinsky’s seminal The Rite of Spring to the circus stage. Pulsating with tension and infused with dark humour, this distinctive production from Artistic Director Yaron Lifschitz confronts humanity’s interconnectivity, our inherent sexual desire and our relationship with divinity.\nFeaturing a piercing lighting design by Veronique Benett and a stirring new composition by Phillippe Bachman for the first half, Sacre penetrates the senses and stirs the soul.\nCirca Contemporary Circus is one of the world’s leading performance companies. Since 2004, from their base in Brisbane, Australia, they have toured the world—performing in more than 40 countries to over 1.5 million people. Their works have been greeted with standing ovations, rave reviews and sold-out houses across six continents.\nUnder the direction of circus visionary Yaron Lifschitz, Circa features an ensemble of exceptional, multi-skilled circus artists. They are a regular fixture at leading festivals and venues in New York, London, Berlin and Montreal with seasons at Brooklyn Academy of Music, the Barbican Centre, Les Nuits de Fourvière, and the Chamäleon Theatre, as well as at major Australian festivals.\n"
      }
    ]
  },
