  {
    "@id": "_:g6613780",
    "@type": [
      "http://schema.org/Play"
    ],
    "http://schema.org/url": [
      {
        "@id": "https://www.lediamant.ca/en/programming/action"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/image": [
      {
        "@id": "https://www.lediamant.ca/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/2024-Action-Opengraph-1-1024x538.jpg"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Action !"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "World Premiere\nHave you always dreamed of being part of the live audience for the filming of a television show ? This is your chance !\nThéâtre à Tempo’s new show will transport you to the set of a 1960s television station. You&#8217;ll be welcomed with open arms by our audience coordinator and charmed by our team of experienced and multi-talented actors. From superheroes to singers to cooking shows, all of the talent will blow you away !\nWhile doing their best to navigate the cameras, micros, projectors and other set elements, they will be directed by our very famous (and somewhat vain) director. Our stars will also be accompanied by a team of dedicated technicians whose approach is more or less conventional and definitely acrobatic.\n"
      }
    ]
  },
